        I'm Charles. This site used to be home to <strong>Charles IT</strong>, my old tech-help
        business. Now it's my workshop: the place I put the things I build for fun.
      </p>
      <p>
        I build most of these by <strong>vibe coding</strong>: I describe what I want, an AI helps write the code,
        and we go back and forth until it feels right. It's how a hamster ended up with a family tree.
      </p>
      <p>I draw in plain text too: Pip one character at a time, and a <a href="/ascii/">whole sketchbook</a> of ASCII art.</p>
      <p>Got an idea, found a bug, or just want to say hi? Find me on <a href="https://github.com/NXT549">GitHub</a>.</p>
